    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d353">

                <pb facs="0330" n="310" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg310"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extracts.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Pike to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 224.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Legation,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">The Hague,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-03-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 9, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    despatch of the 15th of February, No. 142.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>The Jews have taken to buying our bonds largely, as they get them at a <pb
                        facs="0331" n="311" xml:id="pg311"/> rate which pays them near 10 per cent.
                    for their money. I am told the transactions at Amsterdam amount to near two
                    millions weekly.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with great respect, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JAMES S. PIKE.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
